From b8b35fa6a85e7909e709cd3e90abc9e4ef7ddc06 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Siddhartha Srivastava <siddhartha@delphai.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 15:22:16 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] Testnet fixes: scheduled job-module upgrades, uwc-testnet,
 mempool persistence (build step 7)

- jobstate.Params.Upgrades and Params.At(height): rule changes take effect from an activation
  height, so a node replaying from genesis applies each one where the network adopted it (the
  devnet could not be synced after unscheduled changes). Params.Rules versions rule changes that
  live in code; the pool bond basis is Rules >= 1.
- chaincfg.UWCTestNetParams (--uwctestnet): fresh genesis and magic, 30-block reply windows,
  240-block challenge window, Rules 1, a new 2-of-3 council; uwcctl selects it with UWC_NET=testnet.
- pearld saves its mempool to mempool.dat on shutdown and re-admits it on startup (the devnet
  lost pending dispute moves in a restart).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017Li1NuWZZGrbS2dbWLqQUj
